      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "使出强大的招式就能赢吗……？\n宝可梦对战可没有这么简单！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F7F51FA5F3A5927768462DB5F0F5C3180FD8D62541720262026FF1F000A5B9D53EF68A65BF9621853EF6CA167098FD94E487B805355FF01001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我为了让别人明白这一点，\n一直在不断地战斗。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E3A4E868BA9522B4EBA660E767D8FD94E0070B9FF0C000A4E0076F457284E0D65AD5730621865973002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是想变强的话，\n我来教教你能减少受到的伤害的招式……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也就是“墙”的重要性吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F60F353D85F3A76848BDDFF0C000A62116765655965594F6080FD51CF5C1153D7523076844F245BB3768462DB5F0F2026202600100001BE00000A4E5F5C31662F201C5899201D768491CD8981602754273002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要对战就跟我说一声。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89815BF962185C318DDF62118BF44E0058F03002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可以教你“墙”有多厉害，\n准备好了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EF4EE565594F60201C5899201D6709591A53895BB3FF0C000A51C65907597D4E865417FF1F001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还没",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD86CA10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你不想准备我也理解，\n一定是因为不想打输吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E0D60F351C6590762114E5F740689E3FF0C000A4E005B9A662F56E04E3A4E0D60F362538F9354273002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦使用的招式，\n能减少对手的攻击造成的伤害！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n有些人把这种招式叫做“墙”！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A64F7F7528768462DB5F0FFF0C000A80FD51CF5C115BF9624B7684653B51FB9020621076844F245BB3FF0100100001BE00000A67094E9B4EBA628A8FD979CD62DB5F0F53EB505A201C5899201DFF01001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你也太强了！\n根本不需要我来教你什么是“墙”吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E5F592A5F3A4E86FF01000A6839672C4E0D970089816211676565594F604EC04E48662F201C5899201D5427FF1F001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但既然都说好要教了，\n就讲讲我的宝可梦使用的招式吧……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4665E2713690FD8BF4597D898165594E86FF0C000A5C318BB28BB2621176845B9D53EF68A64F7F7528768462DB5F0F542720262026001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "反射壁可以在一段时间内\n减少对手的物理攻击造成的伤害。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53CD5C0458C153EF4EE557284E006BB565F695F45185000A51CF5C115BF9624B768472697406653B51FB9020621076844F245BB33002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "光墙可以在一段时间内\n减少对手的特殊攻击造成的伤害。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5149589953EF4EE557284E006BB565F695F45185000A51CF5C115BF9624B768472796B8A653B51FB9020621076844F245BB33002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来自对手的招式的伤害变少了，\n我方也就能在行动时拥有更多选择。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "676581EA5BF9624B768462DB5F0F76844F245BB353D85C114E86FF0C000A621165B94E5F5C3180FD5728884C52A865F662E5670966F4591A900962E93002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呃，对打赢自己的对手\n说东道西也太惭愧了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n再说了，你看着就像是\n会把各种招式有效组合使用的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5443FF0C5BF962538D6281EA5DF176845BF9624B000A8BF44E1C9053897F4E5F592A60ED61274E86300200100001BE01000A518D8BF44E86FF0C4F60770B77405C3150CF662F000A4F1A628A540479CD62DB5F0F670965487EC454084F7F752876844EBA3002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把各种招式有效地组合使用，\n将胜利收入囊中吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
